    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13107" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">densĭtas</span></b> , ātis,
			f.
		densus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>thickness, density</i> (perh. not ante-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">limus spissatur et in densitatem coit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					35, 15, 51, § 178</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chartae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					13, 12, 24, § 78</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 11,
					3, 2, § 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Isa. 9, 18 al.</span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sententiarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 8, 5, 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">figurarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					9, 2, 72</span></i>
			.</div>
